 if key=='neewer':item['ratings']='Packs 7.4 V / 2600 mAh. USB dual charger+cable, no wall adapter listed. Input 5 V / 2.1 A; output CH1 8.4 V / 0.6 A / 5 W. CH2/simultaneous total not explicit. Broad protection claims, no numeric pack continuous current/trip thresholds/contact drawing.'
